[{"title":"咏晴","author":"杨弘道","text":"二月已破春将残，连朝风雨春犹寒。\n烟消日出好天色，城隅花柳犹堪观。\n萋萋芳草平沙路，乘兴招君共君步。\n恨无樽酒助清欢，赖有溪藤书鄙句。\n荒城势与河流湾，凭高望远开愁颜。\n天低野阔树如荠，几点翠色符离山。\n寓形宇内宜自适，吾土他乡奚所择。\n与君同立东风中，一笑相看谁是客。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"常武殿试护卫歌","author":"杨弘道","text":"夷门上倾辽水浑，东方日出天下明。\n汤盘既铭德日新，万国贡篚来燕京。\n朱门霜戟崇元勋，凤毛麟角歌振振。\n白弓长箭红鹤翎，紫薇垣外罗天兵。\n鲲鹏变化实通津，百年圣神相继承。\n正大天子寿万春，恒山风暖河源清。\n爰得方召为虎臣，虎穴生子被奇文。\n殿前较艺羽卫陈，弓弰拂弦霹雳声。\n聚星玉版湛玄云，宣城紫毫点姓名，高门继世承天恩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"谒诗","author":"杨弘道","text":"我梦神游入官府，少年掖翁出东庑。\n傍人相指窃笑语，掖翁少年乃宗武。\n须臾呼我傍檐楹，闻汝颇有能诗声。\n奈何低首就驱役，更勿赴我诗坛盟。\n惭惶趋出肩背缩，伥伥步绕山之麓。\n忽闻笑语愕睨之，小桥流水环青竹。\n仙人杂坐陈壶觞，举酒揖我邀我尝。\n数杯万虑都不记，恍然寝室明晨光。\n人生大抵如梦尔，梦饮陶陶寤犹喜。\n益知饮酒可忘怀，市东走访刘夫子。\n先生衰发不胜簪，研丹点句传青衿。\n世缘消尽唯好饮，纵欲酌我囊无金。\n元年建亥月，官有陈省杂。\n尝欲醉先生，省杂岂苟合。\n元年建亥月，官有吕咨议。\n尝欲醉先生，咨议亦诚意。\n阳月风日如春熙，梅花三两开南枝。\n二官清要少公事，愿从先生一访之。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪晴夜半月出戏效李长吉","author":"杨弘道","text":"瘦日已匿昆崙西，太虚漫漫圬浊泥。\n浓愁蠹心欲成粉，耳根似觉残蝉嘶。\n孤萤尾暗蜗声静，银阙照耀神惊迷。\n冷光直上三万丈，团黄一点通灵犀。\n天花飘尽桂花发，阳乌却避城乌啼。\n树枝不动印空碧，凝云树外横长堤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"琪树叹","author":"杨弘道","text":"初见琪树梢出墙，再见琪树花飞香。\n凉风萧萧雁南翔，岘首山前多稻粱。\n龙沙高马肥如羊，汉阳汉阴为猎场。\n旅雁哀鸣野水傍，琪树晚实天早霜。\n不独琪树少颜色，中州草木皆萎黄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王子端溪桥濛雨图","author":"杨弘道","text":"皇风皞皞吹王民，乐哉大定明昌人。\n文章与时相高下，黄山竹溪丽而醇。\n秦碑晋帖落万纸，明珠白璧非常珍。\n兴陵佳气成五色，圣孙龙衮居紫宸。\n三十六宫诵佳句，翠帘不捲杨花春。\n子端振衣起辽海，后学一变争奇新。\n黄山惊叹竹溪泣，鼎钟骚雅潜精神。\n云山烟水无常形，泼墨不复求形真。\n挽弓杨叶百中后，众人击节高人颦。\n君不见传呼画师阎立本，池上愧汗沾衣巾。\n丹青驰誉尚如此，溪桥濛雨徒自尘。\n淄川贱士长安客，品题不虑傍人嗔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"杨弘道","text":"一雨破烦暑，独园涵晚清。\n高人澹无虑，客子若为情。\n残照望中下，乱蝉声里明。\n冥冥百灵散，何处觅亏成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赵司理山甫","author":"杨弘道","text":"身喜沾皇化，心惭赞老成。\n青衫初借著，白发已潜生。\n会计唯期当，康宁未暇营。\n如何清夜梦，常绕大堤行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10609,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留别刘伯成王景伯","author":"杨弘道","text":"公干文无敌，羲之字有声。\n三年今日别，千里只轮行。\n学海君能至，为山我未成。\n受田如古制，应伴野夫耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10610,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"别仲经","author":"杨弘道","text":"相逢尝共被，东县与西州。\n无策不成事，有身空远游。\n如君勤问学，度日亦穷愁。\n濡沫能微湿，生涯善自谋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10611,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"麟游秋怀","author":"杨弘道","text":"败叶落还落，北山深复深。\n暮云封远恨，凉吹和微吟。\n镜里双蓬鬓，霜馀一絮衾。\n求仁又何怨，安取四知金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10612,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"杨弘道","text":"襄邓留多日，淄青即故乡。\n落花萦绮席，飞燕拂雕梁。\n巢稳由知择，风飘未可量。\n履新冠已敝，上下岂无常。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10613,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"答张仲髦","author":"杨弘道","text":"韩杜遗编在，今谁可主盟。\n故人相敬爱，健笔过题评。\n风铎不成曲，候虫常自鸣。\n吾诗正如此，未敢受虚名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10614,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陪赵节使游自雨亭","author":"杨弘道","text":"西郊迎使节，飞盖转崇墉。\n石逗楚天雨，山巢炭谷龙。\n清溪罗带曲，杂树锦帏重。\n更觉晋公乐，幅巾儿侄从。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10615,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠郑尊师","author":"杨弘道","text":"茫茫云著地，摵摵雨交天。\n篁竹连河上，青茅尽海边。\n栖迟聊应化，放旷且谈玄。\n相对蒲团坐，清风为肃然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10616,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游石龙窝","author":"杨弘道","text":"何处浮休宅，山公从葛强。\n苍崖晴散雨，红树晚凋霜。\n翠琰寻诗读，银瓶汤酒尝。\n兹游乘逸兴，不觉到斜阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10617,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠马升公","author":"杨弘道","text":"学出韬钤外，身从筦库还。\n著书期后世，辟谷卧空山。\n渺渺追前列，区区若是班。\n尚为妻子累，时复见人间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10618,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠吕鹏翼","author":"杨弘道","text":"燕市重来日，东风两鬓皤。\n行穿鞍马过，意厌客尘多。\n青眼常相见，朱门不重过。\n如君古漆井，澄湛已无波。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10619,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风雨夜泊","author":"杨弘道","text":"舵鸣风逆水，大缆再维舟。\n竞起如相约，喧呼久未休。\n收灯阴漠漠，听雨夜悠悠。\n料得茅斋里，家人为我愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10620,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵田长卿","author":"杨弘道","text":"欲伴秦人隐，桃源何处寻。\n俯惭鱼在藻，仰羡雀投林。\n未有丝生鬓，宁无血染襟。\n回头望乡国，霭霭暮云深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10621,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和鉴上人","author":"杨弘道","text":"畏日照城郭，谁家庭户清。\n禅房留过客，诗笔见高情。\n仙果根株异，湘弦节奏明。\n如风行水上，文理自天成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10622,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赵晋卿二首 其一","author":"杨弘道","text":"寒更不易旦，松竹满庭风。\n未寝觉灯暗，欲挑怜烬红。\n四邻飞化蝶，一室学冥鸿。\n吾道本如此，孰为穷与通。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10623,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵赵晋卿二首 其二","author":"杨弘道","text":"寒更会有旦，松竹静无风。\n一室虚生白，半窗明映红。\n能文韩吏部，归隐汉梁鸿。\n吾道本如此，孰为穷与通。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10624,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喜闻特赐麻知几及第","author":"杨弘道","text":"麻子明经术，诗名亦远扬。\n连年不中第，扫迹欲深藏。\n广誉开宸极，新恩照敕黄。\n少时以病罢，归路益生光。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10625,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"抱璞","author":"杨弘道","text":"抱璞人间世，从渠知不知。\n但能安义命，何用祷神祇。\n乳下子初育，桑柔蚕亦孳。\n众人应昧此，扰扰竞奔驰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10626,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重到砀山示白文卿","author":"杨弘道","text":"不解营微利，元非市井人。\n麦秋农事远，花月客途贫。\n路隔鱼山水，衣馀亳社尘。\n小儿无倚赖，梦里鹿台春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10627,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示亨甫","author":"杨弘道","text":"静退非今日，疏慵自昔年。\n平君心上地，全我性中天。\n文史閒来读，形神困即眠。\n梦中归故里，瑶草碧和烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10628,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶作","author":"杨弘道","text":"碧草含秋意，黄云起暮容。\n归鸦昏且噪，去雁远无踪。\n杯酒因循醉，明人邂逅逢。\n身名犹碌碌，正望日疏慵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10629,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"邻野","author":"杨弘道","text":"故宫成市井，卜宅地非偏。\n门掩依茅栋，身閒乐性天。\n苔花侵砌上，瓠叶荫窗前。\n有子营家事，何须二顷田。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10630,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阻隆曲寨","author":"杨弘道","text":"十月雷惊蛰，黄云接地阴。\n冰衔丹水细，山拥武关深。\n濡沫思灵沼，伤弓失邓林。\n通途施陷阱，之子独何心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10631,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"麻刺史复职","author":"杨弘道","text":"长风起天末，奄忽捲浮云。\n冰雪春自释，芝兰久弥薰。\n廉颇时再用，邹湛世无闻。\n一掬岘山泪，樽前分付君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10632,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"荆楚","author":"杨弘道","text":"荆楚三年客，风尘七尺躯。\n青蝇点白璧，赤水得玄珠。\n息谤能无辨，酬恩正勉图。\n忧勤生逸乐，鱼稻老江湖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10633,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"嵊城","author":"杨弘道","text":"嵊城看月色，望极若微阴。\n光射星辰暗，气迷闾巷深。\n人和为善守，蚁附觉难侵。\n我亦耽诗者，围中不废吟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10634,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王飞伯","author":"杨弘道","text":"吟诗何所得，白发早生头。\n始觉虚名误，应为达士羞。\n梁园遇飞伯，俊气挟清秋。\n嵩洛引归思，因余故少留。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10635,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送麻信之","author":"杨弘道","text":"爱客出天性，君来心事违。\n穷愁诗兴浅，风雨杏花稀。\n相对忘饥渴，高谈订是非。\n穰城二月尾，吾亦欲东归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10636,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠弹琴吕道士","author":"杨弘道","text":"蜗舍侵阛阓，兴居厌市声。\n灵宫有琴隐，一室若冰清。\n境静三尸伏，调孤一凤鸣。\n从今数来往，毋送亦毋迎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10637,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"乐道","author":"杨弘道","text":"白首来何暮，青衫宠若惊。\n浮荣能几日，高节冠平生。\n良史不虚美，真儒集大成。\n读书多乐事，六十眼犹明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10638,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吾道","author":"杨弘道","text":"众好常违俗，孤清且自成。\n食苗维皎皎，止棘信营营。\n莫为虚名误，宜因微罪行。\n何思复何虑，吾道付神明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10639,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吊彦深","author":"杨弘道","text":"何物如金惜，医来欲致功。\n难遮前路黑，惊见缺壶红。\n北渚遗居室，东郊寓殡宫。\n劳心成底事，五十六年中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10640,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吊解飞卿","author":"杨弘道","text":"一昔传君逝，闻之久怆然。\n孤儿几灭性，孀姊已华颠。\n与客谒茶去，点酥尝自煎。\n如何从此别，谁识是终天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10641,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夏雨","author":"杨弘道","text":"坐对云峰起，已欣风腋清。\n螟蝗犹未殄，天地岂无情。\n轰磕雷音转，蜿蜒电影明。\n滂沱洗烦暑，灾害不能成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10642,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"击柝","author":"杨弘道","text":"击柝者谁子，夜天星正繁。\n绛纱明燕寝，黄耳警豪门。\n雀鼠耗仓粟，豺狼踰塞垣。\n客窗求睡稳，嗟尔漫喧喧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10643,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"月下闻笛","author":"杨弘道","text":"三弄传遗谱，谁当清夜吹。\n香飘丹桂子，声裂翠筠枝。\n呜咽星河动，悠扬风露悲。\n侵晨拂明镜，绿鬓恐成丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10644,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"颍州西湖","author":"杨弘道","text":"曲岸奁明镜，微风皱碧罗。\n谁将比西子，我独忆东坡。\n亭古落涂塈，露凉荒芰荷。\n放生仁号在，鱼鳖赖恩波。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10645,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雁","author":"杨弘道","text":"肃肃南飞雁，微生也解谋。\n草黄沙碛远，水阔洞庭秋。\n霄汉人何慕，关山客自愁。\n夕阳堪入画，零乱下汀洲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10646,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"澄心斋诗","author":"杨弘道","text":"退食公园后，焚香即燕居。\n镜明含万象，水净见群鱼。\n幕府当荆楚，官曹塞簿书。\n灵台尘不到，作计未为疏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10647,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题子产庙","author":"杨弘道","text":"相郑称遗爱，云亡感圣人。\n养民殊夏日，出涕比祥麟。\n故国多乔木，虚堂若有神。\n褰裳病徒涉，岁暮客愁新。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10648,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘节副内乡新居","author":"杨弘道","text":"去职未云久，幽人时到门。\n剧谈臻性理，随意具盘飧。\n凿井城隅宅，买牛江上村。\n圣朝深眷遇，安得守田园。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10649,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梦庵","author":"杨弘道","text":"吾子元居屋，经营颇用心。\n移花红满槛，种竹翠成林。\n爱画分三品，收书费一金。\n十年方有此，安可梦中寻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10650,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寓济源","author":"杨弘道","text":"几年无定止，生理与谁谋。\n欲结黄茅屋，如营白玉楼。\n咏归沂水暮，招隐桂丛幽。\n乡里称为善，怀哉马少游。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10651,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风霾","author":"杨弘道","text":"墙下开蔬圃，盘飧得助多。\n春畦不甲坼，沴气夺阳和。\n青失南山色，白生北渚波。\n暮年能委顺，彼亦奈吾何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10652,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唁高士美","author":"杨弘道","text":"王室方求士，辕门亦选材。\n劻勷逢彼怒，侦伺望尘回。\n士命轻如纸，诗名冷若灰。\n君归无所赠，长折浙江梅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10653,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"病树吟","author":"杨弘道","text":"病树仆河滨，长吟喻此身。\n摧残凡几日，湿朽不堪薪。\n两府风烟接，十年往复频。\n故人怜我老，相见益相亲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10654,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过济南宿洪济院赠海州果上人因寄乡中亲友","author":"杨弘道","text":"沧海居何远，慈云出未还。\n将迁僧宝塔，就礼佛头山。\n邂逅逾三宿，夤缘见一斑。\n预闻亲旧在，喜色破衰颜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10655,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重到灵岩寺","author":"杨弘道","text":"七岁尝来此，于今五十年。\n当时随杖屦，名刹在林泉。\n已废嗟何及，犹存亦偶然。\n先茔耕垦后，浓露湿荒烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10656,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"故人","author":"杨弘道","text":"疾风巢再毁，乌鹊却飞回。\n嗟我岂殊此，故人安在哉。\n重遭难食厄，远冒畏途来。\n莫问交疏密，交疏亦可哀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10657,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭刘叔京","author":"杨弘道","text":"甲庚俱旧识，类聚不同方。\n过客传皆死，知君今独亡。\n无儿为继世，有弟托遗孀。\n吾道微如缕，伤时复自伤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10658,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭王子正","author":"杨弘道","text":"匹妇主中馈，虽贫生理存。\n一编藏丽则，只影卧黄昏。\n漫下陈蕃榻，虚沾文举樽。\n北平家世绝，衔恨入荒原。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10659,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿普照寺","author":"杨弘道","text":"被酒暑增剧，漱茶神少清。\n旅人须授馆，侍者讵忘情。\n方篾铺霜滑，虚棂界月明。\n晨兴求纸笔，枕上有诗成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10660,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵孟驾之清明会饮城西桃花下","author":"杨弘道","text":"出郭到花坞，何劳人远寻。\n已降诗笔健，更怯酒杯深。\n名士仍知己，清谈可净心。\n新篇谁协律，别后欲长吟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10661,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"济渎庙","author":"杨弘道","text":"焰焰谢仙火，北风吹欲然。\n重源灵迹在，乔木性天全。\n殿宇瞻遗构，碑词阅旧镌。\n后来知有考，凤鸟至何年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10662,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"慈湖客夜","author":"杨弘道","text":"凉意江城早，秋声客夜多。\n露凋佳树木，月照旧山河。\n争战何时定，功名两鬓皤。\n湖边营垒近，隔水听笙歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10663,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"醴泉寺诗 其一","author":"杨弘道","text":"贤相读书处，黉堂更不开。\n尝闻先子说，直到暮年来。\n失路穿溪涧，褰裳出草莱。\n山形苍玉玦，古殿倚崔嵬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10664,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"醴泉寺诗 其二","author":"杨弘道","text":"老柏参天色，流泉直殿回。\n树从何代有，水自上方来。\n破日期留宿，残僧病可哀。\n索然高兴尽，欲去尚徘徊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10665,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留别高君玉","author":"杨弘道","text":"羡君中岁早知还，择胜栖身意自閒。\n二顷良田十亩竹，一溪流水四围山。\n客中把酒聊乘兴，愁里题诗亦强颜。\n明日东风吹破袂，仙居回首白云间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10666,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"投黄司李","author":"杨弘道","text":"未脱来时旧衽衣，语言面目复何施。\n无心求僭士人服，糊口可为童子师。\n过世有缘蒙顾遇，穷途乏力仗扶持。\n汉江十月萧萧雨，一夕颠毛半作丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10667,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"六月十四日济渎庙即事","author":"杨弘道","text":"霖雨方能救旱田，廉纤不称立秋前。\n南风飒飒披苍竹，四海浮浮起白烟。\n云汉数章因尽废，神灵诸说定虚传。\n瓶罂一勺清源水，惭愧他家望有年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":10668,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]